      "caption": "Exactly 13 numerical fields are scored per supplier call: four fields for each of three suppliers, plus the daily budget. Supplier identity/coverage must also be correct for a complete extraction. This is controlled language, not an unrestricted commercial document corpus."
    },
    {
      "key": "model_latency",
      "number": "B.5",
      "path": "study_results/ollama_dissertation_20261012/figures/model_latency.png",
