      "caption": "Bars show median recorded call time; upper whiskers show the 95th percentile, not a confidence interval. The local model was warm following development. Hardware and integration costs were not monetised."
    },
    {
      "key": "paired_service",
      "number": "B.6",
      "path": "study_results/ollama_dissertation_20261012/figures/paired_service.png",
