      "caption": "The reader, numerical planner and hard release controls are retained. Delegation and priority selection change. LangChain implements the extension with conditional runnable branches and a planning tool."
    },
    {
      "key": "architecture_model_calls",
      "number": "E.2",
      "path": "study_results/architecture_study_20261013/figures/model_calls.png",
