      "caption": "Accuracy is scored against the policy available before ordering. Active promotion covers days 2–6. Explicit policy routing does not demonstrate that the model itself improved its reasoning."
    },
    {
      "key": "architecture_inventory_effects",
      "number": "E.4",
      "path": "study_results/architecture_study_20261013/figures/inventory_effects.png",
